@_ZL36AttrDoc_CUDADeviceBuiltinSurfaceType = internal constant [328 x i8] c"The ``device_builtin_surface_type`` attribute can be applied to a class\0Atemplate when declaring the surface reference. A surface reference variable\0Acould be accessed on the host side and, on the device side, might be translated\0Ainto an internal surface object, which is established through surface bind and\0Aunbind runtime APIs.\00", align 16
@_ZL36AttrDoc_CUDADeviceBuiltinTextureType = internal constant [328 x i8] c"The ``device_builtin_texture_type`` attribute can be applied to a class\0Atemplate when declaring the texture reference. A texture reference variable\0Acould be accessed on the host side and, on the device side, might be translated\0Ainto an internal texture object, which is established through texture bind and\0Aunbind runtime APIs.\00", align 16
@_ZL18AttrDoc_CUDAGlobal = internal constant [18 x i8] c"No documentation.\00", align 16
@_ZL24AttrDoc_CUDAGridConstant = internal constant [305 x i8] c"The ``__grid_constant__`` attribute can be applied to a ``const``-qualified kernel\0Afunction argument and allows compiler to take the address of that argument without\0Amaking a copy. The argument applies to sm_70 or newer GPUs, during compilation\0Awith CUDA-11.7(PTX 7.7) or newer, and is ignored otherwise.\00", align 16
