@_ZL17AttrDoc_SelectAny = internal constant [413 x i8] c"This attribute appertains to a global symbol, causing it to have a weak\0Adefinition (\0A`linkonce <https://llvm.org/docs/LangRef.html#linkage-types>`_\0A), allowing the linker to select any definition.\0A\0AFor more information see\0A`gcc documentation <https://gcc.gnu.org/onlinedocs/gcc-7.2.0/gcc/Microsoft-Windows-Variable-Attributes.html>`_\0Aor `msvc documentation <https://docs.microsoft.com/pl-pl/cpp/cpp/selectany>`_.\00", align 16
